		(comp (ref "R15") (value "33k") (footprint "") (description "S002-schematic-image-read: R15 HP/LP network resistor (value reads as 33k, verify). Added in parallel with R14 when Switch1 closed (LP position). Removing R15 models HP position (switch open)."))
